# Pembuatan User Otomatis

## File users.txt

```text
user1
user2
user3
```

## Script create_user.sh

```bash
#!/bin/bash

while read username
do
    useradd -m $username
    echo "$username:${username}@123" | chpasswd
    echo "User $username berhasil dibuat"
done < users.txt
```

## Menjalankan Script

```bash
sudo ./create_user.sh
```
